==2006 card==
From the back of the 2006 card:

'''FUN FACTS!'''

The original [[RL|Red Line]]™ wheels had torsion bar [[bent-axle suspension]] when introduced in 1968! Red Line™ wheels were [[NCRL|brought back]] in [[HotWheelsCollectors.com|online]] for collectors!

==2010 Treasure Hunts card==
From the back of the 2010 Treasure Hunts card:

'''Born:''' 1983<br />
'''Birthplace:''' Wolfsburg, Germany<br />
'''Designer:''' Volkswagen Group<br />
'''Specialty:''' With big rear scoop, race suspension, custom fenders, open roof and exposed rear engine, this Volkswagen was made to "beet" the competition on and off-road.

